Most melons contain B vitamins which account for most of your body's energy production. B vitamins are required by your body to process sugars and carbs.&#xD;
One of the amazing benefits of melon is that it contains collagen which maintains the integrity of the cell structure in all connective tissues including skin.&#xD;

