Navel Orange
&#xD;
Navel oranges are one of the healthiest fruits you can eat, filled with vitamin C, fiber, potassium, and low in calories. Consuming navel oranges more often may protect against heart disease, cancer, and diabetes while also helping to improve memory, blood pressure, immune system, and overall health.
&#xD;
Health benefits:
&#xD;
&#xD;
Helps Prevent Cancer - Navel oranges are wonderful sources of both vitamin C and hesperidin.&#xD;
Control Your Diabetes - Navel oranges are a great source of fiber.&#xD;
Heart Healthy - Navel oranges are high in potassium.&#xD;
Better Skin - Navel oranges are good for your skin, helping to protect from skin damage caused by the sun and pollution.&#xD;
The fruit is considered a wonderful appetizer and blood purifier.&#xD;

